  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Featured Video]]></title>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each post below uses the core Featured Image block. Two posts have a <strong>Featured Video</strong> set in the post editor sidebar, so the video replaces the image: one is a YouTube URL embedded through oEmbed, the other a direct link to a video file, shown in a video player. The third post has only a featured image, which displays as usual.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

